| Tax input                        | schema1 闭34键保持；budget 模式要求原 actor=`manager`、原 actorId、完整已核 37 权限、真实 prepared15/fullInventory/bodySHA；FI/recovery 七槽全部 null；不新增 N、callback、purpose 或权限槽                                                                    |
| runtimeBindings 外层             | schema2 闭5 `schemaVersion/current/legacy/retainedMain13/retainedPreparation15` → 预算专用 schema3 闭6，唯一新增 `prepareAdoption121:Full3`                                                                                                                    |
